abstract: >-
  Native AscendC implementation of the Mamba-2 Structured State Space
  Duality forward and backward operator for Huawei Ascend NPU, with PyTorch
  and Triton-Ascend references, A100 baselines, accuracy tests, benchmarks,
  and msprof profiling artifacts.
